Seems time for me to make an admission-- my friends and I completely do all start of turn and end of turn things in whatever damn order we please.

[/quote]

&nbsp;

for hero decks it&rsquo;s not as important honestly, but you should hit up the villain and enviro decks in the right order at least.&nbsp;
